%<HELP>	#.($349)Catalog of iceMASTER Products
%<HELP>	#.sp 1
%<HELP>	#Welcome to the %rs2 \b%rs1\r Family Overview.
%<HELP>	#.sp 1
%<HELP>	#%rs2's \b%rs1\r emulators
%<HELP>	#are in-circuit emulators designed for use in
%<HELP>	#developing and debugging circuits and embedded software based on
%<HELP>	#wide variety of single-chip microcontrollers.
%<HELP>	#This is an overview of the functions and capabilities
%<HELP>	#of the \b%rs1\r emulators which can expedite your
%<HELP>	#development of hardware and software, and ease system integration.
%<HELP>	#.sp 1
%<HELP>	#Feel free to make copies of the demo diskette and
%<HELP>	#pass those copies on to other engineers who may be interested.
%<HELP>	#.sp 1
%<HELP>	#Press the \bTab\r key to highlight the chip architecture about which
%<HELP>	#you would like more information and then press \bEnter\r:
%<HELP>	#.sp 1
